    D4 -->|< 0| D6[Recurse left]
    D4 -->|> 0| D7[Recurse right]
    D6 --> D2
    D7 --> D2

    E --> E1[Check root NULL]
    E1 -->|Yes| E2[Print empty message]
    E1 -->|No| E3[Recurse left sub tree]
    E3 --> E4[Print word and meaning]
    E4 --> E5[Recurse right sub tree]

    F --> F1[Read target word]
    F1 --> F2[Locate target node recursively]
    F2 --> F3{Node found?}
    F3 -->|No| F4[Return root unchanged]
    F3 -->|Yes| F5{Number of children?}
    F5 -->|0 children| F6[Free and return NULL]
    F5 -->|1 child| F7[Replace with child and free]
    F5 -->|2 children| F8[Find inorder successor]
    F8 --> F9[Copy successor data]
    F9 --> F10[Recursively delete successor]
```

